# 5 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Vila Mossvale\pOnde a chuva encontra abrigo\ne a natureza cria raízes.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_TownSign_Text_1:
# 6 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Mossvale Town\pWhere rain finds shelter\nand nature takes root.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_TownSign_Text_2:
# 7 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Aldea Mossvale\pDonde la lluvia halla refugio\ny la naturaleza echa raíces.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_PokemonCenterSign_Text_0:
# 14 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Centro Pokémon\pUma pausa na jornada.\nCuidado e descanso para\lseus POKéMON.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_PokemonCenterSign_Text_1:
# 15 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Pokémon Center\pA break from your journey.\nCare and rest for\lyour POKéMON.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_PokemonCenterSign_Text_2:
# 16 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Centro Pokémon\pUna pausa en tu viaje.\nCuidado y descanso para\ltus POKéMON.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_NoticeSign_Text_0:
# 23 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Aviso aos visitantes\pCuide das plantas e mantenha\nos caminhos limpos.\pA lama nas botas já faz\nparte da visita!$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_NoticeSign_Text_1:
# 24 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Notice to visitors\pCare for the plants and keep\nthe paths clean.\pMuddy boots are already\npart of the visit!$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_NoticeSign_Text_2:
# 25 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Aviso a los visitantes\pCuida las plantas y mantén\nlos caminos limpios.\p¡El barro en las botas ya\nforma parte de la visita!$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_MartSign_Text_0:
# 32 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
	.string "Loja Pokémon\pSuprimentos para explorar\nMossvale e seguir viagem.$"

MossValeTown_EventScript_MartSign_Text_1:
# 33 "data/maps/MossValeTown/scripts.pory"
